    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d284">

                <pb facs="0613" n="529" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg529"/>

                <head>No. 280.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The President
                        to King Kaldkaua.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Mansion</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-10-11"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 11,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To His Majesty <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Kalakaua</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Honolulu, via San
                        Francisco:</hi></p>
                <p>Your Majesty’s kind words of sympathy are no less gratifying to the people of
                    this country than to me, and in their name I thank you.</p>
                <closer><signed>GROYER CLEVELAND.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
